<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 578 0 R
/E (At the onset of the DECODE season, we began brainstorming ideas to address the archaeological challenge. Through teamwork and collaboration, we innovated, iterated and refined our robot to prepare for each competition. After every event, we evaluated our Pluses and Deltas, allowing us to intentionally improve our design, programming, teamwork, and work ethic by learning from  both our successes and setbacks. As the season progressed, we reached a turning point. After finishing second to last In Meet 1,, we recognized that our current approach and performance would not allow us to be competitive at ILT. So, we adapted by meeting outside of school, expanding into additional days and hours, committing ourselves to accomplish our goal. This shift improved our robot performance and helped us grow into a more resilient team.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [44]
>>
endobj
