/P 580 0 R
/T (    At CAMS Site Day, an annual event where future freshmen and families explore the campus, our robotics team showcased competitive FTC robotics to over 400 middle school students. Visitors observed the design process firsthand and learned how programming, engineering, and teamwork come together in competition. Team members also engaged prospective students in conversation about joining the FTC program in high school, resulting in over 30 committed recruits for next season. Handed out brochures: We handed out flyers that contained info about our team's mission and vision statement. Scrimmage invitations: Our team invited visiting students to our future FTC meets. Robot Demo: Our drive team presented out current robot and showed students' our progress so far. )
/E (    At CAMS Site Day, an annual event where future freshmen and families explore the campus, our robotics team showcased competitive FTC robotics to over 400 middle school students. Visitors observed the design process firsthand and learned how programming, engineering, and teamwork come together in competition. Team members also engaged prospective students in conversation about joining the FTC program in high school, resulting in over 30 committed recruits for next season. Handed out brochures: We handed out flyers that contained info about our team's mission and vision statement. Scrimmage invitations: Our team invited visiting students to our future FTC meets. Robot Demo: Our drive team presented out current robot and showed students' our progress so far. )
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [16]
>>
