<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 581 0 R
/E (At LA Makers Faire our team hosted a booth dedicated to sharing more about the FIRST program to our local STEM community. Our team highlighted how FTC creates a space where students can develop their teamwork, leadership, and STEM skills in preparation for professional work environments. There we taught students how to drive and control a sphere robot, presented to parents of students what FTC is and how to get involved with their own local robotics team. We also held a fundraiser for our Canada cup premier event by selling team merch such as key chains, 3D printed Dinosaurs, sticker, and pins. After introducing FIRST as a program, we then showcased what our team has done with the season through holding hands on robot demonstrations, displaying our engineering portfolio, as presenting our 226 Point Solo Run. )
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
