<<
/Title (Because many of our current FTC members previously competed in Dodson Middle School FTC Team, RoboDolphins 25370, we hosted a CAD workshop. During the workshop, our members taught members of RoboDophins some fundamental CAD skills, including constraints and dimensioning, the use of assemblies, and subsystems. Students were also assigned hands on design challenge to create a design that can fully secure the ball from all sides using CAD. To support continued learning,  we shared instructions on how to access the FTC parts Library and additional CAD resources.  Ball activity Design Challenge : After the workshop, our CAD team challenged students of RoboDophins25370 to create a design that can fully secure the ball from all sides using ONLY the parts provided and               FASTENED mates.)
/Dest [17 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 4210 0 R
>>
